---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Photo from '../components/Photo.astro';
import Arrow from '../components/Arrow.astro';
import SourceDetails from '../components/SourceDetails.astro';
import content from '../data/content.json';
const home=content.find(p=>p.route==='/')!;
---
<Layout title="Support, community and a way forward">
<section class="home-hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">In Paul’s memory. For our community.</p><h1>Support.<br/>Community.<br/><em>A way forward.</em></h1><p class="lead">We support male victims and survivors of domestic abuse, teach healthy relationships and bring people together through activity.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/donate/">Make a difference <Arrow/></a><a class="text-link" href="/join-us/">Join our community <Arrow/></a></div></div><figure class="hero-photo"><Photo name="hero" alt="PLF riders in blue and yellow jerseys gathered at Claire House during their LEJOG challenge" eager sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 52vw"/><figcaption>The PLF community, riding together in Paul’s memory</figcaption></figure></div><div class="hero-baseline"><p>Built on friendship. Carried forward by community.</p><p><strong>Looking for support?</strong> <a href="/get-support/">We’re here to help you find your next step ↗</a></p></div></div></section>
<section class="section section-soft"><div class="wrap"><div class="intro-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">What we do</p><h2>Different ways to help.<br/>One shared purpose.</h2></div><p class="lead">The Paul Lavelle Foundation began with a group of friends who wanted something positive to come from a devastating loss. Today, that purpose lives through support, education and connection.</p></div><div class="work-links"><article class="work-item"><span class="number">01 / SUPPORT</span><h3>A listening ear.<br/>Practical support.</h3><p>Person-centred therapeutic support, advocacy and advice for men experiencing or recovering from domestic abuse.</p><a class="text-link" href="/what-we-do/">How we can help <Arrow/></a></article><article class="work-item"><span class="number">02 / EDUCATION</span><h3>Healthier relationships.<br/>Stronger futures.</h3><p>Workshops for schools, colleges and workplaces, and the For You Project for young people aged 10–18.</p><a class="text-link" href="/what-we-do/healthy-relationship-education/">Our education work <Arrow/></a></article><article class="work-item"><span class="number">03 / COMMUNITY</span><h3>Get outside.<br/>Feel connected.</h3><p>Free community activities that bring people together to move, talk and work towards personal goals.</p><a class="text-link" href="/activity-groups/">Find your activity <Arrow/></a></article></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">A place to belong</p><h2>Good company.<br/>Something to look forward to.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/activity-groups/">Explore our groups <Arrow/></a></div><div class="activity-grid"><a class="activity-item" href="/activity-groups/#running"><div class="photo-frame"><Photo name="running" alt="Members of the PLF running group on a coastal trail"/></div><div class="activity-label"><h3>Run together</h3><Arrow/></div><p>From a first run to a new personal goal, find encouragement along the way.</p><span class="activity-meta">Three groups · beginners welcome</span></a><a class="activity-item" href="/activity-groups/#cycling"><div class="photo-frame"><Photo name="cycling" alt="PLF cycling club members gathered with their bikes"/></div><div class="activity-label"><h3>Ride together</h3><Arrow/></div><p>Shared routes, good conversation and a reason to get out on the road.</p><span class="activity-meta">Experienced riders · 20+ mile rides</span></a><a class="activity-item" href="/activity-groups/#swimming"><div class="photo-frame"><Photo name="swimming" alt="PLF open-water swimming group gathered on the beach"/></div><div class="activity-label"><h3>Swim together</h3><Arrow/></div><p>A community group with experienced instructors to guide and support you.</p><span class="activity-meta">Contact the organisers before joining</span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="section giving-section"><div class="wrap giving-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Keep the work going</p><h2>Your kindness helps<br/>make the next step possible.</h2><p>Every gift helps sustain the foundation’s work. Together, we can keep support, education and community activities moving forward.</p><a class="button" href="/donate/">Support the foundation <Arrow/></a><p class="giving-note">Giving is handled by our existing donation provider, JustGiving.</p></div><div class="giving-reasons"><div><span>01</span><p>Frontline support for men affected by domestic abuse</p></div><div><span>02</span><p>Healthy relationship education for children and young people</p></div><div><span>03</span><p>Community groups for physical and mental wellbeing</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Come together</p><h2>Our events & challenges</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/events/">Visit the events page <Arrow/></a></div><div class="events-empty"><div><span class="status">Looking ahead</span><h3>More moments to share.<br/>Watch this space.</h3></div><div><p>There are no upcoming events in our current preview. In the meantime, explore our community groups or look back at the events that brought us together.</p><div class="actions"><a class="text-link" href="/activity-groups/">Join a community group <Arrow/></a><a class="text-link" href="/events/#past-events">Past events <Arrow/></a></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section section-white"><div class="wrap story-grid"><figure class="story-photo"><Photo name="paul" alt="Paul Lavelle, whose memory inspired the foundation"/><figcaption>Remembering Paul Lavelle</figcaption></figure><div class="story-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Our friend. Our inspiration.</p><h2>It started with Paul.<br/>It continues with all of us.</h2><p>After losing Paul to domestic abuse in May 2017, his friends and family came together to honour his memory and raise awareness of domestic abuse towards men.</p><p>His legacy is a foundation built on friendship, with a determination to make life better for others.</p><a class="text-link" href="/our-story/">Read Paul’s story <Arrow/></a></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap"><SourceDetails page={home} label="More about the foundation and its history"/></div></section>
</Layout>
